            "text": "<p>The \"Free Sticker Pack\" block is a custom Checkout UI Extension built with Preact and Shopify's native web components that allows customers to seamlessly add a complimentary gift to their order. Driven by admin-configurable settings for the target Variant GID, custom heading, and optional subtext, the extension dynamically fetches the product's image and details via a GraphQL query and renders them in a responsive grid layout. It leverages the Storefront Cart API to handle the \"Add\" action without page reloads, while incorporating robust error handling and lifecycle cleanup to silently hide the component if misconfigured, ensuring the core checkout experience is never disrupted.</p><p></p><p>Add any product to your cart and go to checkout to see it in action!</p>",
